      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machesney_Park%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During World War II, Machesney Field served as an Army Air Corps stop for fighters ferried to the Soviet Union.",
